<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 1.5 bln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 1.5 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction December 3 versus November 26 :</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days    99/78	344/351</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.02/3.01   3.33/3.36</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.02/3.01   3.34/3.38</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.01/3.00   3.33/3.35</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million  183/331   1,318/1020</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    239/331   1,900/1,020</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.5 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 39,602 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
